license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/personacore-np"
url: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/personacore-np"
abstract: >-
  personacore-np is a from-scratch 13.9M GPT inference engine in pure NumPy,
  with an optional MLX backend for the Apple GPU. No PyTorch at serve time.
  A fresh clone can reproduce the public proof with make infer, which builds
  fixtures from the public slim checkpoint m1-demo-v1 and runs the suite.
keywords:
  - NumPy
  - GPT
  - inference
  - MLX
  - from-scratch
date-released: 2026-07-28
